        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TD\n    classDef ui fill:#3b82f6,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#fff,font-weight:bold;\n    classDef backend fill:#8b5cf6,stroke:#6d28d9,color:#fff,font-weight:bold;\n    classDef tool fill:#f59e0b,stroke:#d97706,color:#fff,font-weight:bold;\n    classDef ai fill:#10b981,stroke:#059669,color:#fff,font-weight:bold;\n    classDef report fill:#ec4899,stroke:#be185d,color:#fff,font-weight:bold;\n\n    User([User / Tester]) :::ui\n    UI[Frontend Guided Wizard&lt;br/&gt;1. Target Type&lt;br/&gt;2. Scan Type&lt;br/&gt;3. Target App] :::ui\n    \n    Backend[FastAPI Backend Orchestrator&lt;br/&gt;Creates Scan Job scan_id] :::backend\n    StatusLoop[Real-Time Progress Loop&lt;br/&gt;GET /api/scan-status/scan_id&lt;br/&gt;&#39;Running SAST / LLM Reasoning...&#39;] :::ui\n\n    Router{Conditional Router&lt;br/&gt;Which Pathway?} :::backend\n    \n    Tool1[Web SAST&lt;br/&gt;Semgrep / PHP Code Parser] :::tool\n    Tool2[Web DAST&lt;br/&gt;ZAP Proxy / Traffic Parser] :::tool\n    Tool3[Mobile SAST&lt;br/&gt;JADX Decompiler / Manifest] :::tool\n    Tool4[Mobile DAST&lt;br/&gt;MobSF / Logcat / Traffic] :::tool\n    \n    Norm[Normalize Results&lt;br/&gt;Standardized Findings JSON] :::backend\n    \n    LLM1[LLM Pass 1: Assessor&lt;br/&gt;Ollama - Vulnerability Reasoning] :::ai\n    LLM2[LLM Pass 2: Triager&lt;br/&gt;Ollama - False Positive Removal] :::ai\n    \n    Report[Final Clean Report&lt;br/&gt;HTML / Markdown] :::report\n    Confirmed[Confirmed Findings List] :::report\n    Discarded[Discarded Audit Appendix] :::report\n\n    User --&gt;|Accesses Web App| UI\n    UI --&gt;|POST /api/scan| Backend\n    Backend --&gt;|Return scan_id| StatusLoop\n    Backend --&gt; Router\n    \n    Router --&gt;|Web + SAST| Tool1\n    Router --&gt;|Web + DAST| Tool2\n    Router --&gt;|Mobile + SAST| Tool3\n    Router --&gt;|Mobile + DAST| Tool4\n    \n    Tool1 --&gt; Norm\n    Tool2 --&gt; Norm\n    Tool3 --&gt; Norm