        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TD\n    subgraph L1[\&quot;Layer 1: Presentation Layer (Frontend UI)\&quot;]\n        UI[\&quot;3-Step Guided Wizard\&quot;]\n        Status[\&quot;Live Progress Polling Box\&quot;]\n        ReportUI[\&quot;Report Renderer &amp; Display Engine\&quot;]\n    end\n\n    subgraph L2[\&quot;Layer 2: Backend Orchestration (FastAPI)\&quot;]\n        API[\&quot;API Controller &amp; Validator\&quot;]\n        JobMgr[\&quot;Async Job Manager (scan_id)\&quot;]\n        Router[\&quot;Pathway Router\&quot;]\n    end\n\n    subgraph L3[\&quot;Layer 3: Scanning &amp; Extraction Layer\&quot;]\n        WebSAST[\&quot;Web SAST Driver (Semgrep / PHP)\&quot;]\n        WebDAST[\&quot;Web DAST Driver (ZAP / Traffic)\&quot;]\n        MobSAST[\&quot;Mobile SAST Driver (JADX Decompiler)\&quot;]\n        MobDAST[\&quot;Mobile DAST Driver (MobSF / Logcat)\&quot;]\n    end\n\n    subgraph L4[\&quot;Layer 4: Data Normalization Engine\&quot;]\n        Norm[\&quot;Standard Findings JSON Converter\&quot;]\n    end\n\n    subgraph L5[\&quot;Layer 5: Dual-Pass Local AI Pipeline (Ollama)\&quot;]\n        PE1[\&quot;Prompt Engine 1 (Vulnerability Assessor)\&quot;]\n        LLM1[\&quot;Local LLM Pass 1 (Primary Assessor)\&quot;]\n        PE2[\&quot;Prompt Engine 2 (False-Positive Auditor)\&quot;]\n        LLM2[\&quot;Local LLM Pass 2 (Triage &amp; Auditor)\&quot;]\n    end\n\n    subgraph L6[\&quot;Layer 6: Report Storage &amp; Audit Layer\&quot;]\n        Confirmed[\&quot;Confirmed Real Findings\&quot;]\n        Discarded[\&quot;Discarded Audit Log\&quot;]\n        ReportGen[\&quot;HTML / Markdown Report Generator\&quot;]\n    end\n\n    UI --&gt;|1. POST /api/scan| API\n    API --&gt;|2. Create Job| JobMgr\n    JobMgr --&gt;|3. Return scan_id| Status\n    Status -.-&gt;|Poll GET /api/scan-status| JobMgr\n\n    JobMgr --&gt; Router\n    Router --&gt;|Web SAST| WebSAST\n    Router --&gt;|Web DAST| WebDAST\n    Router --&gt;|Mobile SAST| MobSAST\n    Router --&gt;|Mobile DAST| MobDAST\n\n    WebSAST --&gt; Norm\n    WebDAST --&gt; Norm\n    MobSAST --&gt; Norm\n    MobDAST --&gt; Norm\n\n    Norm --&gt; PE1\n    PE1 --&gt; LLM1\n    LLM1 --&gt; PE2\n    PE2 --&gt; LLM2\n\n    LLM2 --&gt;|Confirmed| Confirmed\n    LLM2 --&gt;|False Alarms| Discarded\n\n    Confirmed --&gt; ReportGen\n    Discarded --&gt; ReportGen\n    ReportGen --&gt;|4. GET /api/scan-results| ReportUI\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="kYQVqrpvpC4F9rUQAE2_-1">
